{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Our soul</b> — Because we saw that those who fear YHWH and hope for Him escaped, therefore our soul waited for Him." "And the meaning of <b>our help</b> — corresponding to 'in the greatness of power' that he mentioned with the king." "<b>And our shield</b> — corresponding to 'the king,' as in: 'our shield, see, O Elohim.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:22.455739365Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}